   Now for some post-game ramblings.....

   The swamp level is new to me, is this new to pl9??, I loved it. 

   Blessed scrolls of identify should identify all items under
      one heading with-out exception. It's really annoying to 
      waste a holy water to bless a regular scroll of identify
      and get only one ring identified.

   Though it's been hashed about before, I think choking to death over
      food is bogus. 

   How about Artifact-Armor? Like Sir Gallahads Plate Mail that brings
      your AC to -10.

   Bring back the Stooges.

   Just like nymphs are an endless supply of potions and tools, 
      Minotaurs of wands, and soldiers of rings, there should be
      one for scrolls. I always find my polypile running short on
      scrolls. Am I missing a monster that always carries one? If not,
      how about each leprechaun carrying a scroll of gold detection?

   How about including those living tree from the Lord of the Rings?
      If you polymorphed the corpse it would have a chance of turning
      into a wand.

   How about including sand paper in the game. You could use it only
     once to turn a regular shield into a shield of reflection,
     make a -2 weapon into a  -1 weapon ( but not into the positives ),
     and for making wands into blank wands suitable for writing on 
     with magic markers to make into the wand of your choice.

   Congrats to the dev team for a great game and similar sentiments
from my wife also. 

